    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Non-owning, read-only view of a contiguous byte sequence. It references existing memory and never allocates or frees storage. Analogous to <ref refid="classONNX__LIGHT__NAMESPACE_1_1utils_1_1RefString" kindref="compound">RefString</ref> but for raw bytes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
